ge-thumbnail\" title=\"Forged\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<img src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/ForgedMagnetite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230122073734\" srcset=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/ForgedMagnetite.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/268?cb=20230122073734 1x, https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/7/72/ForgedMagnetite.png/revision/latest?cb=20230122073734 2x\" data-relevant=\"1\" class=\"pi-image-thumbnail\" alt=\"Forged\" width=\"270\" height=\"244\" data-image-key=\"ForgedMagnetite.png\" data-image-name=\"ForgedMagnetite.png\" />\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t</a>\n\t\t\t\t</figure>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</div>\n\n\n\n\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-panel pi-border-color wds-tabber\">\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t<ul class=\"wds-tabs\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tStats\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t\t<li class=\"wds-tabs__tab\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tabs__tab-label\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\tInfo\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\t\t\t\t</li>\n\t\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t</ul>\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content wds-is-current\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Island\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Region</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">Finlay</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t<table class=\"pi-horizontal-group\">\n\t<caption class=\"pi-header pi-secondary-font pi-secondary-background pi-item-spacing\">Volume Cost</caption>\n\t\n\t<thead>\n\t\t<tr>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">Ore</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">Refined</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<th class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-label pi-secondary-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">Forged</th>\n\t\t\n\t\t</tr>\n\t</thead>\n\t\n\t<tbody>\n\t<tr>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Ore\">?$/studs</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Refined\">$600/stud</td>\n\t\n\t\t<td class=\"pi-horizontal-group-item pi-data-value pi-font pi-border-color pi-item-spacing\" data-source=\"Forged\">$595/stud</td>\n\t\n\t</tr>\n\t</tbody>\n</table>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t\t\t<div class=\"wds-tab__content\">\n\t\t\t\t<section class=\"pi-item pi-group pi-border-color\">\n\t\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\" data-source=\"Version Added\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Version Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">v1.2.0</div>\n</div>\n\n<div class=\"pi-item pi-data pi-item-spacing pi-border-color\">\n\t\n\t\t<h3 class=\"pi-data-label pi-secondary-font\">Date Added</h3>\n\t\n\t<div class=\"pi-data-value pi-font\">January 21st, 2023</div>\n</div>\n\n</section>\n\n\t\t\t</div>\n\t\t\n\t</section>\n\n\n\n</aside>\n\n<p class=\"mw-empty-elt\"></p><p>Magnetite is one of the many ores that can be found around <a href=\"/wiki/Finlay_Island\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Finlay Island\">Finlay Island</a> and The <a href=\"/wiki/The_Moon\" title=\"The Moon\">moon</a>. Magnetite ore can only spawn in <a href=\"/wiki/Lightslate\" title=\"Lightslate\">Lightslate</a> nodes. The raw form of Magnetite takes on a purple color with a fluorescent glow in cubic shapes. Putting Magnetite through a Refinery increases its value to $600 per stud. The price will remain the same even if refined Magnetite is forged. Despite having a 1/1000 chance to spawn only at night, Magnetite is relatively common to find on the surface. Magnetite will persist into the day if it spawns at night and despawn later, similar to other ores.\n</p>\n<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 180px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Magnetite_on_pi_island.png/revision/latest?cb=20250608175042\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Magnetite on pi island\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"155\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Magnetite on pi island.png\" data-image-key=\"Magnetite_on_pi_island.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Magnetite_on_pi_island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250608175042\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Magnetite_on_pi_island.png/revision/latest?cb=20250608175042\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Magnetite on pi island\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Magnetite_on_pi_island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250608175042\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"180\" height=\"155\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Magnetite on pi island.png\" data-image-key=\"Magnetite_on_pi_island.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/d/da/Magnetite_on_pi_island.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/180?cb=20250608175042\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Magnetite_on_pi_island.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<p>The ore stands out due to its vibrant color and glow, which is lost after being refined, or forged\n</p><p>As with any other material in the game, you can use refined and forged Magnetite to complete schematics. But is NOT recommended. Magnetite does not glow at all when used to complete schematics.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Trivia\">Trivia</span></h2>\n<ul><li>Refined Magnetite used to sell for $1,000 per stud before it was debuffed in the update on August 8, 2023, which revamped the map.</li>\n<li>Magnetite can be found on the moon! This is most likely very rare due to the rarity of the ore itself, and the placement.<figure class=\"thumb  show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 230px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Magnetite_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest?cb=20260404220423\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Magnetite on the moon\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" height=\"161\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Magnetite on the moon.png\" data-image-key=\"Magnetite_on_the_moon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Magnetite_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/230?cb=20260404220423\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Magnetite_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest?cb=20260404220423\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"Magnetite on the moon\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Magnetite_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/230?cb=20260404220423\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"230\" height=\"161\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"Magnetite on the moon.png\" data-image-key=\"Magnetite_on_the_moon.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/5/5c/Magnetite_on_the_moon.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/230?cb=20260404220423\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:Magnetite_on_the_moon.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">Magnetite on the moon</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>Magnetite is the only ore in the game that decreases in value when forged. This is in reference to how in real life when magnets are heated to high temperatures, they lose their magnetic force, thereby devaluing their efficacy. In other words, only refine Magnetite, DON'T forge it.</li>\n<li>Magnetite, <a href=\"/wiki/Ore\" title=\"Ore\">Ore</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Pyrite\" title=\"Pyrite\">Pyrite</a>, <a href=\"/wiki/Lithium\" title=\"Lithium\">Lithium</a>, and <a href=\"/wiki/Stone\" title=\"Stone\">Stone</a> are the only square-like ores in the game.</li>\n<li>In the Typical Developers Discord server, Magnetite has reputedly been \"eaten\" by various users.\n<ul><li>This is possibly due to how Magnetite can resemble candy, regardless of which form it is in—ore, refined, or forged.</li></ul></li></ul>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Media\">Media</span></h2>\n<figure class=\"thumb mw-halign-left show-info-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File/Thumb\" style=\"width: 162px\"> \t<a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png/revision/latest?cb=20231126175547\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;DO NOT EAT MAGNETITE&quot; sticker, from the Typical Developers Discord server.\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"162\" height=\"162\" class=\"thumbimage lazyload\" data-image-name=\"DO NOT EAT MAGNETITE.png\" data-image-key=\"DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png/revision/latest?cb=20231126175547\" /></a> \t<noscript><a href=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png/revision/latest?cb=20231126175547\" class=\"mw-file-description image\"><img alt=\"&quot;DO NOT EAT MAGNETITE&quot; sticker, from the Typical Developers Discord server.\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png/revision/latest?cb=20231126175547\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"162\" height=\"162\" class=\"thumbimage\" data-image-name=\"DO NOT EAT MAGNETITE.png\" data-image-key=\"DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/oaklands/images/8/8d/DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png/revision/latest?cb=20231126175547\" /></a></noscript> \t<figcaption class=\"thumbcaption\"> \t\t \t\t\t<a href=\"/wiki/File:DO_NOT_EAT_MAGNETITE.png\" class=\"info-icon\"><svg><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-info-small\"></use></svg></a> \t\t \t\t \t\t \t\t\t<p class=\"caption\">\"DO NOT EAT MAGNETITE\" sticker, from the Typical Developers Discord server.</p> \t\t \t</figcaption> </figure>\n<table class=\"navbox mw-collapsible\" style=\"background:#291F1D; width:100%; padding:.1em; margin:.5em auto; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\" data-expandtext=\"Open\" data-collapsetext=\"Close\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th style=\"width:105px; background:#140401; -webkit-border-radius:5px; -moz-border-radius:0 10px 10px 0\"><span style=\"float:left; padding-left:10px; padding-top:4px; font-size:90%\"><a href=\"/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav\" title=\"Template:Ore Nav\"><span title=\"View this template\">v</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template_talk:Ore_Nav\"><span title=\"Discuss this template\">d</span></a> • <a target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noreferrer noopener\" class=\"text\" href=\"https://oaklands.fandom.com/wiki/Template:Ore_Nav?action=edit\"><span title=